紋、落書き、お漏らし\n断面図・透過、腹ボコ・ボテ、クリ等肥大化、尻肉波打ち、苦痛系・傷\n\n■構図\n・『表情が見える生尻アップ』構図をたくさん\n　（各ページ1つ以上、特に大きめのコマ）\n　-対面座位（または駅弁）で、ローアングル等で尻を強調\n　-尻は割れ目はっきり、ピストンで尻のラインは歪めない（丸みある桃尻で）\n　-表情（\"両目\"、口）、背中＆腰、結合部と小陰唇が見える\n　（両目は閉じない）\n　-中出し時は、上記 + 顔は左向き（両目必須）、尻はやや右向きでアップ\n・局部修正は黒線でお願いします\n・イメージ\n　https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/92659700\n　https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/102848956\n　https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/90486895\n　https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/12327073\n　https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/108152561\n\n■ご参考\nhttps://skeb.jp/@moketa11/works/232", "nc": 184, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 121020, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "よしをc108「8/15(土)西1-ま52b『きしゃー』」", "screen_name": "yoshiwo999", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/803922882317283329/7FyttFpE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/65842455/1722775567/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 131247, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "がいえん", "screen_name": "jin_morisono", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1699034047299850240/PqMwPw6w.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 6, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 186238, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "久壁おと🍥Skeb受付中", "screen_name": "oto_hisakabe", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/4415123029